&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-outline-level: 1&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #666644; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt;De VerzekeringsRekening (tak 21)&lt;BR&gt;update 22 januari 2009&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #666644; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt&quot;&gt;Voor het VIJFDE jaar op rij kijken wij samen uit naar de rendementen van de verzekeringsrekeningen. &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: red; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt;De beurscrisis 2008 indachtig, meer dan ooit uitkijken naar de winstdeelnames 2008 (de meeste aanbieders informeren in de loop januari - februari, ten laatst maart 2009)&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'&quot;&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = &quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt;Sinds &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt&quot;&gt;Axa&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt&quot;&gt;Belgium&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt; in november 2002 &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt&quot;&gt;Crest&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt; 10 en &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt&quot;&gt;Crest&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt; 30 op de markt bracht, is het aantal verzekeringsrekeningen met geen of&amp;nbsp;bescheiden gewaarborgd rendement enorm toegenomen (zozeer dat einde 2005 beslist werd tot taxatie van ingebracht kapitaal (lees ‘premie’) 1,1% Bijna alle verzekeraars (meer en meer ook bankverzekeraars!) bieden dit product ondertussen aan.&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-spacerun: yes&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;Sinds 3-tal jaar zijn de formules met 0% rentegarantie, waarvan men verwacht dat ze ook met het hoogste totaalrendement zullen uitpakken, die het best scoren. Hoe lager de gewaarborgde rente, hoe meer de verzekeraar zijn handen vrij heeft om wat risicovoller te beleggen en zo het rendement op te krikken! De winstdeelnamecijfers 2008 komende dagen en weken vrij te geven, gaan eenieder zeker sturen naar (nieuwe) keuzes en/of bestaande keuzes bevestigen. De klant kiest en bemint..&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt&quot;&gt;Rendement beleggingsverzekeringen voor 2004 - 2008&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: #666644; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt;In bijgaande tabel staan de rendementen&amp;nbsp;opgevolgd door ons kantoor.&lt;BR&gt;Afgetekende toppers voor 2007 blijven voor de 0%-garantie rekeningen (bij de meeste onder de noemer &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;I&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt&quot;&gt;invest&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/I&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt; of ook &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;I&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt&quot;&gt;dynamic&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/I&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt;)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;B style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-weight: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: #1f497d; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt; mso-themecolor: text2&quot;&gt;GENERALI&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt; en &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;B style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-weight: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: #1f497d; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt; mso-themecolor: text2&quot;&gt;RECORD.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt;Duidelijk beter&amp;nbsp;dan de rest. Voor de versie met minimum garantie, gaan gezamelijk&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;B style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-weight: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: #00b050; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt;ALLIANZ&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt; , &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;B style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-weight: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: #00b050; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt;SWISS LIFE&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt; en weerom &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;B style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-weight: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: #00b050; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt;RECORD&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt; met de eer lopen.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt 35.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;I style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-style: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt;2008: Uitkijken volgende weken en bij uitblijven van ‘uitspringers’, wordt ons advies het vergelijken op basis van gemiddelde beste prestatie over de jaren heen !&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/I&gt;&lt;I style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-style: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8pt; COLOR: #666644; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-language: NL-BE; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/I&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
